    "text": "catcountryutah.com\nwebsite\nSt George\nAWESOME Photos Of St. George, Utah From LONG AGO!\nBy djtischner,\n3 hours agoThe other day I came across some old postcards of St. George, Utah. A lot of these buildings are long gone, but some are still standing. I thought it would be fun to do some side by sides of the postcards from WAY back in the day vs. the way the same land looks today.",
